-- NPCIL Narora Apprentice Recruitment 2026: 80 seats, applications 29 October to 18 November 2026
-- VERIFIED 29 October 2026: GovtJobsAlert, Daily Kiran, JobsLogin and GovtJobsAI agree on 80 seats, the trade/diploma/graduate split, Advertisement No. NAPS/HRM/APPRENTICE/02/2026, dates 29 October 2026 (10.00 am) to 18 November 2026 (4.00 pm), stipends and establishment IDs. Live sitemap checked this run, no NPCIL slug present. The NPCIL careers page did not open from the assistant network during checking, so the article tells candidates to confirm details in the official notification.
